{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And to distinguish and to instruct.</b> For wine and strong drink seize the heart, as it says: אַל לַמְּלָכִים שְׁתוֹ יָיִן, וְלָרוֹזְנִים אֵי שֵׁכָר, פֶּן יִשְׁתֶּה וְיִשְׁכַּח מְחֻקָּק (Proverbs 31:4–5)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:01.557473553Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}